      "writtenOn": "2016-11-29T21:44:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yep. The migration should have happened at bootup. When the wifi service is up, we should have invoked |loadFromStore|. That should take care of all the migration required.",
      "parentUuid": "6def8770_6000e7b4",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2356,
        "startChar": 12,
