    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "6def8770_60d90741",
        "filename": "service/java/com/android/server/wifi/WifiConfigManager.java",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 2495,
      "author": {
        "id": 1079868
      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-11-29T21:02:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So does the legacy store contain both shared and user configs? or only shared configs?  if it contains both, wouldn\u0027t the configs for users that didn\u0027t login be lost after a reboot?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2495,
        "startChar": 12,
        "endLine": 2495,
        "endChar": 47
      },
      "revId": "b7149f7c88cfee3c243e00f2b3bb2109fe40aad5",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "6def8770_3b39f033",
        "filename": "service/java/com/android/server/wifi/WifiConfigManager.java",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 2495,
      "author": {
        "id": 1074459
      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-11-29T21:44:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The legacy store contains both private and shared configs. Once we load all the configs to memory, we invoke |saveToStore| which pushes all the private networks of other users on the device to the new shared store file until that user logs in to the device after upgrade (to get accesss to CE storage).\n\nThe details are in b/29337176.",
      "parentUuid": "6def8770_60d90741",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2495,
        "startChar": 12,
        "endLine": 2495,
        "endChar": 47
      },
      "revId": "b7149f7c88cfee3c243e00f2b3bb2109fe40aad5",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
    },
